OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after being shot
OL,4,Ain the leg
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in hospital after being shot
OL,7,Fin the leg in County Down on Wednesday
OL,8,Fevening.
OL,10,FThe man, who is in his 40s, reported to
OL,11,Femergency services that he had been
OL,12,F"collected" from the Glen estate in
OL,13,FNewtownards in a vehicle by a number of
OL,14,Fpeople at about 20:00 BST.
OL,16,FHe said he was "driven to a green area"
OL,17,Fbetween Ballyreagh Way and Fairfield
OL,18,FCourt, where an unknown man shot him in
OL,19,Fthe calf.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
