OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after being shot
OL,4,Ain the leg
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Gray, from the Police Service
OL,7,Fof Northern Ireland (PSNI), said:
OL,8,F"Everyone has the right to live their
OL,9,Flife free from the threat of violence
OL,10,Fand this brutal attack will leave the
OL,11,Fvictim with lasting physical and
OL,12,Fpsychological trauma.
